      "markdown": "## 思维拓展\n\n( )1.你想让别人和你一起擦窗户,你应该说:\n\nA. Let me clean the classroom. B. Let's clean the windows.\n\nC. Let me clean the windows.\n\n( )2.你想自己擦桌子,你应该说:\n\nA. Let me clean the chair. B. Let's clean the windows.\n\nC. Let me clean the desk.\n\n( )3. 当你想帮助别人时,你应该说:\n\nA. Let you help me. B. Please help me.\n\nC. Let me help you.\n\n( )4. 当别人帮助你时,你应该说:\n\nA. Excuse me. B. Thank you.\n\nC. I'm sorry.\n\n## ，\n\n1. Let's clean the  $ \\underline{\\text{chairs}} $. (chairs,desks)\n\n<div style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"imgs/img_in_image_box_637_2049_823_2220.jpg\" alt=\"Image\" width=\"9%\" /></div>\n\n\nthe window. (Open,Close)\n\n4. Let me clean the ___ (teacher's desk, teachers' office)\n\n___",
